*SPOILER ALERT*

Have you ever noticed what happens when you become weak?  You strength goes
down a point.  So, you eat some food and you strength point returns.  Now for
the spoiler part.  Have you ever tried a applying a blessed unicorn-horn at
this point (ie. when you're weak)?  If you keep applying it, you'll get the
message "You feel much better!"  (or some such message) and your strength point
returns.  If you THEN eat some food, you get ANOTHER strength point returned -
voila!  Your strength just went up a point.  If you eat lumps of royal jelly,
you can go up two strength points each time, and you also get an extra hit
point.  This way you can easily get strengths approaching 18/**.

As for dexterity, the only ways I know of increasing it are poitions of gain
ability or enchanted gauntlets of dexterity.

